(F5 T2 V5: element_dof (6.421) of a unit quad9 with the 2x2 Gauss rule
 (group_integration_points -minimal): 90 values (9 nodes x 10 unknowns),
 the stresses the per-element linear least-squares fit of the 4 point
 values (single element: equal to node_dof), velx/vely the node values.
 Source: Professional 02-08-2026 probe q9 (same input); every slot equal
 within 1e-11 except disx/disy (Professional 0, GNU the fit of the
 integration-point displacement; class B ELEMENT-DOF-DISPLACEMENT).
 Tolerance 1e-5 of the largest value.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 0.5 0
node 3 1 0
node 4 0 0.5
node 5 0.5 0.5
node 6 1 0.5
node 7 0 1
node 8 0.5 1
node 9 1 1
element 1 -quad9 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
group_integration_points 0 -minimal
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 2 3 4 7 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_dof 1 9 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.01
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
